MULT 10 C 3 2    ; 47.65 CH2 (H 4.613)
MULT 11 C 3 3    ; 25.52 CH3 (H 2.733)
MULT 12 C 3 3    ; 15.43 CH3 (H 1.534)
MULT 13 N 3 0    ; nitrogen, 3 bonds, no H -- position OPEN
MULT 14 N 2 0    ; nitrogen, sp2, no H -- position OPEN
MULT 15 O 2 0    ; carbonyl O
MULT 16 O 2 0    ; carbonyl O
MULT 17 O 3 1    ; O-H (the single exchangeable H) -- placement OPEN
